The RapidFuzz R package is a binding to rapidfuzz-cpp
=====================================================

The RapidFuzz R package provides R bindings to rapidfuzz-cpp
(https://github.com/rapidfuzz/rapidfuzz-cpp), the C++ library of the RapidFuzz
project (https://github.com/rapidfuzz), created and maintained by Max
Bachmann. The package takes its name from that project. The string matching
algorithms and their implementation are Max Bachmann's work; the fuzz scorers
derive from FuzzyWuzzy, by Adam Cohen.

The R package is an independent binding. It is not affiliated with, maintained
by or endorsed by the RapidFuzz project or its authors.

